

Inyandiko bigeze: ['html'] kora: { <- (
		ubwacyo
		simbuza: ['&'] na: ['&amp;'],
		simbuza: ['<'] na: ['&lt;'],
		simbuza: ['>'] na: ['&gt;'],
		simbuza: ['"'] na: ['&quot;']
	).
}.


Ibisohoka andika: ([' left trimmed '] kata-imyanya) + [' '] + ( ['and right trimmed'] kata-imyanya) + ['!'], umurongo-mushya.
Ibisohoka andika: ['<html>"html & entities"</html>'] html.
